- Design for data minimization and purpose limitation

## Development Workflow Rules

### AI-Enhanced Development Processes

#### Code Generation Standards

- Use consistent prompt templates for similar tasks
- Specify coding style and formatting requirements in prompts
- Include test case requirements in code generation prompts
- Request documentation and comments for all generated code
- Specify error handling patterns and edge cases
- Include performance optimization requirements
- Request accessibility compliance in UI code generation
- Specify responsive design requirements for frontend code

#### Testing with AI

- Generate comprehensive unit tests for all AI-generated code
- Use AI to create integration test scenarios
- Implement AI-assisted end-to-end test generation
- Use AI for test data generation and mocking
- Implement AI-assisted performance testing
- Use AI for security testing and vulnerability scanning
- Generate accessibility tests for UI components
- Implement AI-assisted regression testing

#### Documentation with AI

- Use AI to generate comprehensive API documentation
- Create user guides and tutorials with AI assistance
- Generate code comments and inline documentation
- Use AI for creating architecture diagrams and flowcharts
- Implement AI-assisted README generation
- Use AI for creating deployment and setup guides
- Generate troubleshooting guides with AI
- Create compliance and security documentation

#### Refactoring with AI

- Use AI to identify code smells and improvement opportunities
- Implement AI-assisted code optimization
- Use AI for dependency updates and migration assistance
- Implement AI-assisted security vulnerability fixes
- Use AI for performance optimization suggestions
- Implement AI-assisted accessibility improvements
- Use AI for code standardization and consistency
- Implement AI-assisted legacy code modernization

#### Quality Assurance with AI

- Use AI for code review and quality assessment
